      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2533,
      "text": "And this [Qur’an] is a blessed reminder which We have sent down. Are you still denying it[21]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 326,
      "ruku": 281,
      "hizbQuarter": 130,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2534,
      "text": "Indeed, We had given Abraham sound judgment before[22], for We know him well.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 326,
      "ruku": 282,
      "hizbQuarter": 131,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2535,
      "text": "When he said to his father and his people, “What are these statues to which you are so devoted?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 17,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 326,
      "ruku": 282,
      "hizbQuarter": 131,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2536,
      "text": "They said, “We found our forefathers worshiping them.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 21,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنبِيَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Anbiyaa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Prophets",
        "numberOfAyahs": 112,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
